{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n お久しぶりになってしまってすいません😓\n \n みんな元気にしてますか？？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 年末色んな番組に出演させて頂いたり、雑誌に載せていただいたり見て欲しいものが沢山あります👀👀\n \n \n \n こんな年末初めて味わうな〜。\n ありがたいことです。\n \n \n \n 去年はもう今の時期にはお休みだったもん！\n \n ありがとうございます😊\n \n \n \n \n \n そしておそくなりましたが、佐々木美玲20歳になりました😙\n 今年は今まで以上にたくさんの方に祝ってもらえてすごい嬉しかったです😌\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日は握手会でいただいたお花を載せていきます🥰\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX1Y1SV8XH0KPYHN108CJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX30NRG96XY951CWV31NG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX40585R0VDADXK3QX7W6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX53D3D6RRMR85QF91V50","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX62GF7FE21YW09WCRCJE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX74ZFCZJ9AZSZ8SJMVFF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX85R6W7ZF4AZ7J1TKKVX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KX96G7HFS1D7MH0B14VKC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 次に続きます👀"}],"source":"archive"}